doc.field:
* Two issues, including the first number, of the newspaper, The Trib;

* Second number of Focus, newsletter of the New York Regional Office of the Anti-Defamation League of B'nai B'rith;

* First three numbers of Borough President Howard Golden's Brooklyn Newsletter;

* First four numbers of the Federal Regional Council newsletter, Region II In View;

* First three numbers of Mayor Edward I. Koch's Mayor's Newsletter;

* An issue of the Federation of Citywide Block Associations's newsletter, News;

* First two numbers of the newspaper City News;

* First two numbers of the Metropolitan New York Nursing Home Association's newsletter, Health Care News;

* An issue of newspaper Politicks & Other Human Interests;

* Calendar of events for the "World of Our Fathers" Jewish Heritage Festival.
